  "description": "In a world where vampires are considered superior and lycans are considered inferior, Seojoon is a half-lycan considered an outsider to both lycans and humans alike. Still, he's determined to keep his head up as a firefighter in a society that doesn't recognize his efforts. As a vampire, Ray doesn’t understand that pride, but he is nevertheless determined to take Seojoon overseas. But the two of them have already splintered apart before, and Seojoon isn’t ready to take a leap of faith just yet. As society and Ray both pressure him into a corner, Seojoon finds himself stumbling into the dark of the night, where he just might find his damnation...or salvation. \n\n(Source: Lezhin)",
